   "start": 286.09,
   "end": 289.3845,
   "speaker": "Ashiana.Griffith",
   "text": "If it's, like, are we gonna reschedule or not?",
   "overlap_candidate": false
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "src": 30,
   "start": 289.3845,
   "end": 292.679,
   "speaker": "Ashiana.Griffith",
   "text": "And if not, I'll just, I'll pop back on.",
   "overlap_candidate": false
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "src": 31,
   "start": 292.88,
   "end": 294.109,
   "speaker": "Ashiana.Griffith",
   "text": "If you want to do that.",
   "overlap_candidate": false
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "src": 32,
   "start": 294.87,
   "end": 307.23,
   "speaker": "Julia Matveyev",
   "text": "I mean, we could just… I don't think, kind of, sharing too much information is going to be particularly useful, since we haven't really had that much time to work on things, but, like.",
   "overlap_candidate": false
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "src": 33,
   "start": 307.23,
   "end": 315.49,
   "speaker": "Julia Matveyev",
   "text": "I mean, I've started some work on the, what, like, terms and conditions, haven't really… don't have much to say about that.",
   "overlap_candidate": false
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
